{"ticker":"GNRC","updated":"2026-10-30T22:51:00Z","profile":{"longName":"Generac Holdings Inc.","shortName":"Generac Holdlings Inc.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","country":"United States","website":"https://www.generac.com","fullTimeEmployees":9400,"marketCap":11675566080,"trailingPE":39.039444,"forwardPE":14.250189,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.5276394,"pegRatio":0.57,"targetMeanPrice":287.72223,"targetHighPrice":375.0,"targetLowPrice":215.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":18,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.162,"earningsGrowth":0.634,"grossMargins":0.39924,"operatingMargins":0.12402,"profitMargins":0.06522,"totalRevenue":4619158016,"beta":1.916,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":296.44,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":134.8,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Generac Holdings Inc. designs, manufactures, and distributes energy technology products and solutions worldwide. The company offers residential automatic standby generators, automatic transfer switch, air-cooled engine home standby generators, and liquid-cooled engine generators; Mobile Link, a remote monitoring system for home standby generators; propane tank monitoring solution; and smart home solutions, such as smart thermostats and a suite of home monitoring products. It also provides smart home energy management devices and sensors for heating and cooling system; smart doorbell cameras; and portable and inverter generators; multiple portable battery solutions; manual transfer switches; outdoor power equipment, including trimmers, field and brush mowers, log splitters, stump grinders, chipper shredders, lawn and leaf vacuums, and pressure washers and water pumps; and home energy storage systems. In addition, the company offers commercial and industrial products comprising cleaner-burning natural gas fueled generators; mega-watt diesel generators; light-commercial standby generators and related transfer switches; stationary generators; single-engine industrial generators; industrial standby generators; industrial transfer switches; light towers, mobile generators, commercial mobile pumps, heaters, and dust-suppression equipment; mobile energy storage systems; battery energy ","summary_zh":"Generac Holdings Inc. 在全球範圍內設計、製造和分銷能源技術產品和解決方案。公司提供家用自動備用發電機、自動轉換開關、風冷發動機家用備用發電機、液冷發動機發電機； Mobile Link，家庭備用發電機遠端監控系統；丙烷罐監控解決方案；以及智慧家庭解決方案，例如智慧恆溫器和一套家庭監控產品。它還提供智慧家庭能源管理設備和暖氣和冷氣系統感測器；智慧門鈴攝影機；以及便攜式和變頻發電機；多種便攜式電池解決方案；手動轉換開關；戶外動力設備，包括修剪機、割草機、割草機、劈木機、樹樁研磨機、削片機、草坪和樹葉吸塵器、高壓清洗機和水泵；此外，該公司還提供商業和工業產品，包括清潔燃燒的天然氣燃料發電機；兆瓦柴油發電機；輕型商用備用發電機及相關轉換開關；固定式發電機；單引擎工業發電機；工業備用發電機；工業轉換開關；燈塔、移動發電機、商用移動泵、加熱器和抑塵設備；移動儲能係統；電池能量","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"特種工業機械","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":181.21,"h":182.57,"l":177.46,"c":179.51,"v":994800},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":178.76,"h":179.13,"l":174.88,"c":175.14,"v":793500},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":175.46,"h":178.38,"l":174.02,"c":178.18,"v":745700},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":179.24,"h":181.61,"l":176.66,"c":181.3,"v":642700},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":181.22,"h":185.37,"l":179.8,"c":183.97,"v":894400},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":183.98,"h":184.57,"l":179.69,"c":181.8,"v":763800},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":183.09,"h":186.22,"l":182.98,"c":185.01,"v":813300},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":185.34,"h":192.72,"l":184.85,"c":187.86,"v":1425300},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":187.67,"h":189.05,"l":184.34,"c":184.39,"v":697900},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":185.9,"h":187.61,"l":183.55,"c":185.71,"v":756300},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":185.81,"h":186.48,"l":180.91,"c":183.61,"v":894400},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":183.99,"h":184.93,"l":179.55,"c":181.29,"v":692000},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":182.55,"h":184.46,"l":180.9,"c":184.04,"v":848900},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":182.96,"h":184.0,"l":180.24,"c":182.28,"v":1594900},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":181.75,"h":186.19,"l":180.59,"c":185.86,"v":1301700},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":186.79,"h":187.81,"l":166.17,"c":166.77,"v":2320300},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":167.81,"h":172.61,"l":166.78,"c":167.36,"v":1360900},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":163.62,"h":165.5