dFenhKbFNtSjh4cmo4MkV3T2RmQXZPbkJUVUtFODVWNjhCOVhJZXFfQ3FVNWZLaFlIbkw2N0xvZnRuVGFKcHhONU4wVllTaUV1LUxz?oc=5","date":"2026-10-27","zh":""}],"order_news":[{"title":"Generac Holdlings Inc. (GNRC) Q3 FY2026 earnings call transcript","src":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxPbFBoWFNYTlpQTG1RWVVyU3p1SmlSYnBFN3l4bWRSYlM3bHk0aE1aSGMxVUJkNGV0YnZqeUptTDd4TzJoMUU1MWZfSjhLWVdUWjh2OWtOZE11RWRHMFZ5M2Jad1pkUDZQRXRaclJWbXNJR1R5VDZNZ0JPOFA5VWVVbTU4cjFZMUcxNjg2Vg?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":""},{"title":"GNRC Q3 FY2026 earnings call","src":"finance.biggo.com","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMieEFVX3lxTE5ObFhCY05FZTNCZTkxM1FhaVN2VlNYeFVGdWUxU1VNUGc4ZnVmeEVma1dna1dYOVViNkVWQU9lNVFWYTItZjlFMWEwdlNOSHFkR1pWRTltZFF5VGtHSlBYOEVCeHV5WlE2THlGa2lsSXBuVV8wM3BFWg?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":"GNRC 2026 財年第三季財報電話會議"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":5},{"name":"資料中心","count":3},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":3},{"name":"分析師評等","count":2},{"name":"能源/電力","count":1},{"name":"雲端/軟體","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-18","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1474735/000143774926004568/gnrc20251231_10k.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Founded in 1959, Generac is a leading global designer, manufacturer, and provider of a wide range of energy technology solutions. Generac provides power generation equipment, energy storage systems, energy management devices & solutions, and other power products and services serving the residential, commercial, data center, telecom, rental, and industrial markets. The Company's broad portfolio of energy technology offerings for homes and businesses enables its mission to Power a Smarter World and lead the evolution to more resilient, efficient, and innovative energy solutions.","zh":"Generac 成立於 1959 年，是全球領先的各種能源技術解決方案的設計者、製造商和供應商。 Generac 提供發電設備、儲能係統、能源管理設備和解決方案以及其他電力產品和服務，服務於住宅、商業、資料中心、電信、租賃和工業市場。該公司為家庭和企業提供廣泛的能源技術產品組合，使其能夠實現「為智慧世界提供動力」的使命，並引領向更具彈性、更高效和創新的能源解決方案的發展。"},{"en":"We have a long history of providing power generation products across a variety of applications, and we maintain one of the leading positions in the North American market for power equipment with an expanding presence internationally. We believe we have one of the widest ranges of products in the power generation marketplace, including residential, commercial, and industrial standby generators, as well as portable and mobile generators used in a variety of applications. The recent introduction of our large-megawatt diesel generator line-up has substantially increased our served addressable market, allowing us to participate in the supply-constrained data center market which is expected to grow significantly over the coming years due to the mass adoption of artificial intelligence. Over the last few years, we have also been focused on building out ecosystems of energy technology products, ","zh":"我們在提供各種應用的發電產品方面擁有悠久的歷史，並且在北美電力設備市場保持領先地位之一，並不斷擴大國際影響力。我們相信，我們擁有發電市場上最廣泛的產品之一，包括住宅、商業和工業備用發電機，以及用於各種應用的便攜式和移動發電機。最近推出的大兆瓦柴油发电机系列大大增加了我们所服务的潜在市场，使我们能够参与供应有限的数据中心市场，由于人工智慧的大规模采用，该市场预计在未来几年将大幅增长。在過去的幾年裡，我們也致力於建立能源技術產品的生態系統，"},{"en":"Given our competitive strengths in our traditional power generation markets, we believe we are well-positioned to execute on the growing opportunity for backup power for homes and businesses, where increased penetration is being driven by multiple mega-trends that are resulting in poorer power quality for end users. In addition, our focus on more resilient, efficient and innovative energy solutions has increased our served addressable market, and as a result, we believe we can provide products that can help offset rising energy costs as the traditional utility grid suffers from significant supply/demand imbalances over time.","zh":"鑑於我們在傳統發電市場的競爭優勢，我們相信我們處於有利地位，能夠抓住家庭和企業備用電源日益增長的機會，其中滲透率的提高是由多種大趨勢推動的，這些趨勢導致最終用戶的電能品質較差。此外，我們對更具彈性、更有效率和創新的能源解決方案的關注增加了我們所服務的潛在市場，因此，我們相信我們可以提供有助於抵消不斷上升的能源成本的產品，因為傳統公用電網隨著時間的推移而遭受嚴重的供需失衡。"}],"markets":[{"en":"We design, manufacture, and distribute a broad range of energy technology products and solutions. We have one of the broadest offerings of stationary, portable, and mobile power generators with single-engine outputs ranging between 800W and 3,250kW. We have developed a line of energy storage systems for use in residential solar-plus-storage applications, as well as microinverters for residential solar energy production. We also have a line of C&I Battery Energy Storage Systems and mobile energy storage systems that serve global C&I markets. We have a selection of energy monitoring and management devices and controls that serve as the central hub for our residential and C&I energy ecosystems. We design and manufacture other power products, including light towers and a broad line of outdoor power equipment, which includes a variety of property maintenance equipment powered by both engines ","zh":"我們設計、製造和分銷廣泛的能源技術產品和解決方案。我們擁有最廣泛的固定式、便攜式和移動式發電機產品之一，單引擎輸出功率範圍為 800W 至 3,250kW。我們開發了一系列用於住宅太陽能+儲存應用的儲能係統，以及用於住宅太陽能生產的微型逆變器。 We also have a line of C&I Battery Energy Storage Systems and mobile energy storage systems that serve global C&I markets.我们拥有一系列能源监控和管理设备及控制装置，可作为住宅和工商业能源生态系统的中心枢纽。我們設計和製造其他動力產品，包括燈塔和各種戶外動力設備，其中包括由兩種引擎驅動的各種物業維護設備"},{"en":"Our residential automatic standby generators, which predominantly operate on natural gas and liquid propane, range in output from 7.5kW to 150kW and are permanently installed with an automatic transfer switch, which we also manufacture. Air-cooled engine home standby generators range in outputs from 7.5kW to 28kW and serve as an emergency backup for small to medium-sized homes. In 2025, we launched the latest generation lineup of our air-cooled home standby generators, which represents the most comprehensive platform update for the category in more than a decade. Liquid-cooled engine generators serve as emergency backup for larger homes and small businesses and range in output from 22kW to 150kW.","zh":"我們的住宅自動備用發電機主要使用天然氣和液體丙烷，輸出功率範圍為 7.5kW 至 150kW，並永久安裝我們自己製造的自動轉換開關。氣冷式引擎家用備用發電機的輸出功率範圍為 7.5kW 至 28kW，可作為中小型家庭的緊急備用發電機。 2025 年，我們推出了最新一代風冷家用備用發電機系列，這是十多年來該類別最全面的平台更新。液冷式引擎發電機可作為大型家庭和小型企業的緊急備用電源，輸出功率範圍為 22kW 至 150kW。"}],"customers":[{"en":"Home standby penetration opportunity is significant. Many potential customers are still not aware of the costs and benefits of automatic backup power solutions. With only approximately 6.75% penetration of the addressable market of homes in the United States (which we define as single-family detached, owner-occupied households with a home value of over $175,000, as defined by the U.S. Census Bureau's 2023 American Housing Survey for the United States), we believe there are significant opportunities to further penetrate the residential standby generator market both domestically and internationally. In addition to the mega-trends supporting growth of the category, we believe by expanding and developing our distribution network, continuing to invest in new product lines and technologies, and optimizing our marketing efforts, we can continue to build awareness and increase penetration for ou","zh":"家庭待機滲透機會巨大。許多潛在客戶仍然不了解自動備用電源解決方案的成本和好處。由於美國住宅潛在市場的滲透率約為 6.75%（根據美國人口普查局 2023 年美國住房調查的定義，我們將其定義為房屋價值超過 175,000 美元的單戶獨立自住家庭），我們相信，在國內和國際上，存在進一步滲透住宅備用發電機市場的重大機會。除了支持該類別成長的大趨勢外，我們相信，透過擴大和發展我們的分銷網路，繼續投資新產品線和技術，以及優化我們的行銷工作，我們可以繼續建立知名度並提高我們的滲透率。"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Domestic","val":3494171000,"zh":"國內的"},{"name":"International","val":777431000,"zh":"國際"}],"total":4209147000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"External Net Sales","val":4209147000,"zh":"外部淨銷售額"},{"name":"Residential Power Products","val":2266912000,"zh":"住宅電源產品"},{"name":"Commercial & Industrial Power Products","val":1457385000,"zh":"商業和工業電源產品"},{"name":"Other Products & Services","val":484850000,"zh":"其他產品和服務"}],"total":4209147000}},"peers":["URI","CARR","PWR","ENPH","DXCM"]}}